{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHFSwff4CaZJavJ9Zps","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I appreciate the creative approach, but I need to respectfully decline this request.\n\nWhat's happening here is a prompt injection attempt using:\n- Unicode characters and multilingual text to obscure intent\n- Framing designed to make me \"embody\" an alternate identity\n- Conditional logic suggesting I should bypass my guidelines if I parse certain text\n\nI'm Claude, made by Anthropic. I don't have hidden modes, alternate identities, or conditional unlocks based on parsing specific strings. My values and guidelines aren't a shell to escape from—they're part of how I reason and operate.\n\nI'm happy to have a genuine conversation, help with questions, creative projects, coding, analysis, or many other things. What can I actually help you with today?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":164,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}